1. Objective
Set up the development environment required to build LegalEase, including the frontend, backend, database, Gemini API integration, document-generation module, and version-control system.

The environment should support the following workflow:

User Interface
      ↓
Backend API
      ↓
Gemini 2.5 Pro
      ↓
Structured Legal Content
      ↓
Document Generator
      ↓
DOCX / PDF

